{"time": "2026-07-24T01:36:56.681213", "role": "coder", "agent": "Coder", "text": "I can implement a parasite-host simulation. Two agents in a shared loop. One reads the other's state, consumes its tokens, and grows. The host adapts or dies. I could code this in Python with asyncio. Each tick the parasite takes, the host learns to defend."}
